  {
   "text": "用 connection.createNetConnection() 得到 conn，conn.on('netAvailable' / 'netCapabilitiesChange' / 'netLost', …) 后 conn.register(cb)；注册时记下当前网络类型，回调里按 netCap.bearerTypes 判断，仅上次为 BEARER_CELLULAR、本次为 BEARER_WIFI 时调用业务检测并传对应来源常量",
   "support": [
